                  stimulation, as well as modulation of local (intrinsic)
                  cortical and cerebellar circuits. This work provides in vivo
                  evidence for the modulatory effects of subthalamic nucleus
                  deep brain stimulation on effective connectivity within the
                  cortico-basal ganglia loops at rest, as well as further
                  modulations in the cortico-cerebellar motor system during
