  date         = {2018},
  abstract     = {Self-transcendent feelings such as gratitude, compassion, and
                  awe are highly relevant for human societies. So far, empirical
                  research has focused more on the relational aspects of these
                  feelings (concrete persons), and less on the spiritual aspects
                  referring to the Sacred in a person’s life. We intended to
