                  stronger peak amplitudes in comparison to the dorsal electrode
                  contacts. Conclusion This process was used to physiologically
                  confirm accurate lead placement in the operating room setting.
                  The modified Go/NoGo task elicited robust neural responses in
                  the Cm-Pf region however the signal was not present in the Vim
                  nucleus region of thalamus along the DBS electrode trajectory.
