                  phenomenological tradition with ecological psychology and
                  dynamical systems modeling. It is argued that radical embodied
                  cognitive science has a long history; it is as a direct
                  descendent of the Jamesian functionalist approach to
                  psychology. This approach to psychology is contrasted with the
