                  Emrich, H.M., Leweke, F.M., Schneider, U., 1997. Towards a
                  cannabinoid hypothesis of schizophrenia: cognitive impairments
                  due to a dysregulation of the endogenous cannabinoid system.
                  Pharmacol. Biochem. Behav. 56, 803–807). However the neural
