                  receptor distribution by applying the dopamine D2/3 receptor
                  agonist radioligand [11C]-(+)-PHNO and mRNA expression data
                  from the AHBA. Since [11C]-(+)-PHNO has a higher affinity for
                  D3 compared to D2 receptors, we hypothesized that there is a
                  stronger relationship between D2/3 non-displaceable binding
