  pages        = {673--676},
  date         = {2005},
  abstract     = {Trust pervades human societies1,2. Trust is indispensable in
                  friendship, love, families and organizations, and plays a key
                  role in economic exchange and politics3. In the absence of
                  trust among trading partners, market transactions break down.
                  In the absence of trust in a country's institutions and
