                  without MCI), indicating that further cognitive decline
                  impacts semantic processing. Finally, lower verbal fluency
                  scores correlated with prolonged N400 congruency effects and
                  with reduced pre-word differences in all PD patients (N = 78).
                  This relevantly points to a role of deficits in
                  temporal-dependent mechanisms in PD, besides prototypical
