                  our insights into the pathogenesis of the disease, where PD is
                  indicated to result from multifactorial etiological factors
                  involving environmental contributions in genetically
                  predisposed individuals. There has been considerable interest
                  in the association between neurological manifestations in PD
                  and in inherited metabolic disorders (IMDs), which are genetic
                  disorders characterized by a deficient activity in the
                  pathways of intermediary metabolism leading to multiple-system
