  issue        = {1},
  pages        = {68},
  date         = {2019},
  abstract     = {Blockchain is a shared distributed digital ledger technology
                  that can better facilitate data management, provenance and
                  security, and has the potential to transform healthcare.
                  Importantly, blockchain represents a data architecture, whose
                  application goes far beyond Bitcoin – the cryptocurrency that
                  relies on blockchain and has popularized the technology. In
