                  decode this representation, word by word, into an English
                  sentence. For each participant, data consist of several spoken
                  repeats of a set of 30–50 sentences, along with the
                  contemporaneous signals from \textbackslashtextasciitilde250
                  electrodes distributed over peri-Sylvian cortices. Average
