                  this end, we recorded LFPs via implanted DBS electrodes from
                  the bed nucleus of stria terminalis (BNST area) in 12 patients
                  (5 OCD, 7 MDD) and from the subgenual cingulate cortex in 7
                  MDD patients (CG25 area). We found a distinct pattern of
                  oscillatory activity with significantly higher α-power in MDD
                  compared with OCD in the BNST area (broad α-band 8–14 Hz;
