  abstract     = {The pathophysiology of essential tremor, especially at the
                  cellular level, is poorly understood. Although no drug has
                  been specifically designed to treat essential tremor, several
                  medications improve tremor, and others worsen it. Studying the
                  mechanism of actions of these medications can help our
