  date         = {2018},
  abstract     = {Abstract (245/250) Paracetamol (acetaminophen, APAP) is one of
                  the most frequently used analgesic agents worldwide. It is
                  generally preferred over non-steroidal antiinflammatory drugs
                  (NSAIDs) as it does not cause typical adverse effects
