  abstract     = {Pilot studies have hinted that serotonergic psychedelics such
                  as psilocybin may relieve depression, and could possibly do so
                  by promoting neural plasticity. Intriguingly, another
                  psychotomimetic compound, ketamine, is a fast-acting
                  antidepressant and induces synapse formation. The similarities
