  pages        = {232--235},
  date         = {2019},
  abstract     = {Rather than acting as a review or analysis of the field, this
                  essay focuses squarely on the motivations for investigating
                  open-endedness and the opportunities it opens up. It begins by
                  contemplating the awesome accomplishments of evolution in
                  nature and the profound implications if such a process could
                  be ignited on a computer. Some of the milestones in our
                  understanding so far are then discussed, finally closing by
                  highlighting the grand challenge of formalizing open-endedness
