                  move: patients −0.47 (95\% CI −1.94, 1.00) versus controls
                  −2.59 (95\% CI −4.46, −0.72)]. Responders performed faster
                  after physiotherapy [mean natural logarithm (ln) reaction time
                  (RT) (ms): follow‐up 6.112 (95\% CI 5.923, 6.301) versus
                  baseline 6.206 (95\% CI 6.019, 6.394), P = 0.010], contrary to
                  non‐responders. Simultaneously, responders showed a recovery
