  date         = {2020},
  abstract     = {The current COVID-19 pandemics is having a major impact on our
                  global health and economies. There is widespread recognition
                  that ecosystem disruption, including land-use change and
                  illegal wildlife trade, is linked to the increasing emergence
                  of zoonotic diseases. Here, we emphasize that protected areas
