  abstract     = {Clinical outcome of deep brain stimulation (DBS) for
                  obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD) shows robust effects in
                  terms of a mean Yale-Brown Obsessive-Compulsive Scale (YBOCS)
                  reduction of 47.7 \% and a mean response percentage (minimum
