                  between specific brain regions, and assessing relationships
                  between these abnormalities and cognitive performance in
                  schizophrenia. Here we review studies that have reported
                  analysis of these brain–behavior relationships. Through this
                  systematic review we found that patients with schizophrenia
                  display abnormalities within and between regions comprising
                  (1) the cortico-cerebellar-striatal-thalamic loop and (2)
