                  Likewise, 5-MeO-DMT decreased BOLD responses in visual cortex
                  (V1) and mPFC. The disruption of cortical activity induced by
                  5-MeO-DMT resembles that produced by phencyclidine and DOI.
                  This, together with the reversal by antipsychotic drugs,
                  suggests that the observed cortical alterations are related to
