                  antipsychotics risperidone and zotepine}},
  author       = {Kimura, Kanako Terakado and Asada, Hidetsugu and Inoue, Asuka
                  and Kadji, Francois Marie Ngako and Im, Dohyun and Mori,
                  Chihiro and Arakawa, Takatoshi and Hirata, Kunio and Nomura,
