  pages        = {793--801},
  date         = {2015},
  abstract     = {The network approach is increasingly being applied to the
                  investigation of normal brain function and its impairment. In
                  the present review, we introduce the main methodological
                  approaches employed for the analysis of resting-state
                  neuroimaging data in Parkinson's disease studies. We then
