               sleep on cognition, memory, motor-sensory integration, spatial
               navigation, large-scale computation and consciousness. Each of
               these topics require appropriate levels of analyses with
               sufficiently high temporal and spatial resolution of neuronal
               activity in both local and global networks, supplemented by
