                  GABA(A) receptors of rat cerebellar synaptosomal membranes
                  were labelled with [(3)H]ethynylbicycloorthobenzoate (EBOB).
                  Allopregnanolone displaced [(3)H]EBOB binding with IC(50) =
                  320 nM. The displacing potency of allopregnanolone was
