                  allopregnanolone can be associated with cerebellar GABA(A)
                  receptors containing alpha(6), beta(2-3) and delta subunits.
                  This might be suitable for physiological modulation of tonic
                  inhibitory neurotransmission via extrasynaptic GABA(A)
