  issue        = {1},
  pages        = {31--38},
  date         = {2019-03},
  abstract     = {OBJECTIVE: To investigate automatic auditory-change detection
                  in patients with Parkinson disease (pwPD). BACKGROUND:
                  Previous results regarding changes in preattentive processing
                  in pwPD have been inconclusive. METHODS: We employed a
                  paradigm assessing the preattentive processing of sequences of
