                  the frequently reported increased risk of children with ASD to
                  develop schizophrenia later in life. Autism Res 2017, 10:
                  1857-1865. © 2017 International Society for Autism Research,
                  Wiley Periodicals, Inc. LAY SUMMARY: Automatic detection of
