                  and circuits related to survival, and that are shared by
                  humans and other animals. The approach shifts the focus from
                  questions about whether emotions that humans consciously feel
                  are also present in other animals, and toward questions about
                  the extent to which circuits and corresponding functions that
                  are present in other animals (survival circuits and functions)
