  date         = {2021-05-01},
  abstract     = {Objective A downside of Deep Brain Stimulation (DBS) for
                  Parkinson’s Disease (PD) is that cognitive function may
                  deteriorate postoperatively. Electroencephalography (EEG) was
                  explored as biomarker of cognition using a Machine Learning
                  (ML) pipeline. Methods A fully automated ML pipeline was
