  pages        = {29--41},
  date         = {2020-06},
  abstract     = {An alien limb is a debilitating disorder of volitional
                  control. The core feature of alien limb is the performance of
                  simple or complex semi-purposeful movements which the patient
                  reports to be unintentional or unwanted, or occasionally in
                  opposition to their intentions. Theories of the mechanism of
