                  to stressors is a crucial prerequisite for a sense of
                  well-being, adequate performance of tasks, and positive social
                  interactions. By contrast, inappropriate responsiveness of the
                  stress system may impair growth and development and may
                  account for a number of endocrine, metabolic, autoimmune, and
                  psychiatric disorders. The development and severity of these
