  pages        = {1600--1606},
  date         = {2017-04-25},
  abstract     = {OBJECTIVE: To develop a risk score that estimates 3-year and
                  5-year absolute risks for aneurysm growth. METHODS: From 10
                  cohorts of patients with unruptured intracranial aneurysms and
                  follow-up imaging, we pooled individual data on sex,
                  population, age, hypertension, history of subarachnoid
