  volume       = {25},
  issue        = {7},
  pages        = {571--581},
  date         = {2021-07},
  abstract     = {Autism Spectrum Conditions are typified by a divergence in
                  cognitive style from that of the non-autistic population.
                  Cognitive differences in autism may underlie significant
                  strengths, but also increase vulnerability to psychopathology
                  such as anxiety, which is a major problem for many autistic
                  people. Many autistic people also do not respond to typical
