               depression since he was a child and started taking
               anti-depressants when he was a teenager. He was told that his
               problems were caused by a chemical imbalance in his brain. As an
               adult, trained in the social sciences, he began to investigate
               whether this was true - and he learned that almost everything we
               have been told about depression and anxiety is wrong. Across the
