               profusion and detail and inspiring in its simple beauty. He has
               never received formal artistic training, yet his renderings
               clearly and beguilingly show subtle differences and
               similaritiesenabling the viewer to see, for example, the
               distinctive features of a dolly varden, a Pacific Coast steelhead
