  pagetotal = {432},
  abstract  = {Experts from a range of disciplines assess the foundations and
               implications of a novel action-oriented view of
               cognition.Cognitive science is experiencing a pragmatic turn away
               from the traditional representation-centered framework toward a
               view that focuses on understanding cognition as “enactive.” This
