                  response rates between the active (3 of 15 subjects; 20\%) and
                  control (2 of 14 subjects; 14.3\%) treatment arms and no
                  significant difference between change in Montgomery-Åsberg
                  Depression Rating Scale scores as a continuous measure upon
                  completion of the 16-week controlled phase of the trial. The
