  pages        = {514--524},
  date         = {2022-12},
  abstract     = {Several pyrazoloquinolinone (PQ) ligands were recently
                  discovered as functionally selective positive modulators at
                  the PQ site of α6-containing GABAA receptors. PQs are also
                  neutral modulators at the benzodiazepine site. We assessed the
                  influence of PQ compounds from three structural groups
                  (PZ-II-029 and related deuterated analogues DK-I-56-1,
                  RV-I-029, DK-I-60-3 and DK-I-86-1; LAU 463 and related
