  pages        = {e2078--e2093},
  date         = {2023-11-21},
  abstract     = {Background and Objectives Advanced therapies (ATs; deep brain
                  stimulation [DBS] or pump therapies: continuous subcutaneous
                  apomorphine infusion [CSAI], levodopa/carbidopa intestinal gel
                  [LCIG]) are used in later stages of Parkinson disease (PD).
