  date         = {2017-11},
  abstract     = {Cognitive function requires the coordination of neural
                  activity across many scales, from neurons and circuits to
                  large-scale networks. As such, it is unlikely that an
                  explanatory framework focused upon any single scale will yield
                  a comprehensive theory of brain activity and cognitive
                  function. Modelling and analysis methods for neuroscience
