                  out-of-sample validation cohort. METHODS: Volumes of tissue
                  activated (VTAs) were constructed in standard space using
                  high-resolution structural MRI and individual stimulation
                  parameters. VTA-based probabilistic stimulation maps (PSMs)
                  were generated to elucidate voxelwise spatial patterns of
