               festination. These results seem to warrant future clinical
               application of this interpersonal synchrony emulation system for
               patients with a variety of motor disorders.},
  keywords  = {Legged locomotion;Humans;Diseases;Computational modeling;Handheld
               computers;Headphones;Parkinson's disease;Gait festination;Stride
