  journaltitle = {Top. Cogn. Sci.},
  date         = {2021},
  abstract     = {The primary goal of this essay is to provide a comprehensive
                  overview and analysis of the various relations between
                  material artifacts and the embodied mind. A secondary goal of
                  this essay is to identify some of the trends in the design and
                  use of artifacts. First, based on their functional properties,
