                  it remains uncertain where the initial α-synuclein aggregates
                  originate. We have hypothesized that Parkinson’s disease
                  comprises two subtypes. A brain-first (top-down) type, where
                  α-synuclein pathology initially arises in the brain with
                  secondary spreading to the peripheral autonomic nervous
