                  dopamine storage capacity. Colon volume and transit times were
                  assessed with CT scans and radiopaque markers. Imaging data
                  from the three groups were interrogated with ANOVA and
                  Kruskal-Wallis tests corrected for multiple comparisons. The
                  PDRBD− and PDRBD+ groups showed similar marked reductions in
                  putaminal FDOPA-specific uptake, whereas two-thirds of iRBD
                  patients had normal scans (P < 10−13, ANOVA). When compared to
