                  databases (EconLit, Embase, Global Health, MEDLINE, PsycINFO)
                  were searched for manuscripts published in peer-reviewed
                  journals in English, French, Italian, Portuguese or Spanish
                  between 1 January 2000 and 31 July 2018 and reporting
                  information on external actors for mental disorders in LMICs.
