                  and Ory-Magne, Fabienne and Regis, Jean-Marie and Maltête,
                  David and Sauvaget, Anne and Rau, Jörn and Schnitzler, Alfons
                  and Schüpbach, Michael and Schade-Brittinger, Carmen and
                  Deuschl, Gunther and Houeto, Jean-Luc and Krack, Paul and
                  Group, Earlystim Study and Negovanska, Velina and Welter,
                  Marie-Laure and Corvol, Jean-Christophe and Agid, Yves and
