                  built a system of classifiers capable of detecting
                  tremor-inducing movement. These classifiers were incorporated
                  into a closed-loop DBS system which changed stimulation
                  voltage in real time to ameliorate tremor. This is the first
                  time that machine learning has been used in a CLDBS system to
                  detect symptoms and change DBS parameters in real time.}
}

