                  purposes. After reconstruction of DBS electrodes (which is
                  possible using three methods and a specific refinement tool),
                  the volume of tissue activated is calculated for two DBS
                  settings using four distinct models and various parameters.
                  Finally, four whole-brain tractography algorithms are applied
                  to the patient's preoperative diffusion MRI data and
