  date         = {2017},
  abstract     = {See Vidailhet et al. (doi:10.1093/brain/awx140) for a
                  scientific commentary on this article.Misdiagnosis among
                  tremor syndromes is common, and can impact on both clinical
                  care and research. To date no validated neurophysiological
