                  cohort comprising 16 rest tremor recordings in tremor-dominant
                  Parkinson's disease and 20 postural tremor recordings in
                  essential tremor, and validated on a second, independent
                  cohort comprising a further 55 tremulous Parkinson's disease
                  and essential tremor recordings. Clinical diagnosis was used
