                  selected for analysis in each patient. The classification
                  accuracy of the new index was assessed by binary logistic
                  regression and by receiver operating characteristic analysis.
                  The diagnostic performance was examined by calculating the
                  sensitivity, specificity, accuracy, likelihood ratio positive,
