                  temporal variant frontotemporal dementia and semantic variant
                  primary progressive aphasia). Impaired cardiac reactivity
                  correlated with gray matter atrophy in a
                  fronto-cingulo-insular network that overlapped correlates of
                  cognitive emotion processing. Interpretation: Autonomic
                  indices of emotional reactivity dissociate from emotion
                  categorization ability, stratifying frontotemporal dementia
