                  studies used price reductions to promote the increased
                  purchase of targeted foods. The first study examined lower
                  prices and point-of-purchase promotion on sales of lower fat
                  vending machine snacks in 12 work sites and 12 secondary
                  schools. Price reductions of 10\%, 25\% and 50\% on lower fat
