  pages        = {435--456},
  date         = {2020-04},
  abstract     = {PURPOSE OF REVIEW: This article reviews the evidence base and
                  recommendations for medical management for secondary stroke
                  prevention. RECENT FINDINGS: Recent developments for secondary
                  stroke prevention include evidence to support the use of
                  short-term dual antiplatelet therapy after minor stroke and
                  transient ischemic attack, direct oral anticoagulants for
