  date         = {2017-07-25},
  abstract     = {It is widely recognized that language plays a key role in the
                  transmission of human culture, but relatively little is known
                  about the mechanisms by which language simultaneously
                  encourages both cultural stability and cultural innovation.
                  This paper examines this issue by focusing on the use of
