  date         = {2021-08},
  abstract     = {Abstract Agricultural trade liberalization has been sometimes
                  accused of being one of the main causes of increasing obesity
                  and overweight in developing countries. However, there is no
                  consensus on the impacts of trade on obesity in the
                  literature. We estimate the impacts of agricultural trade
