                  stepwise increments (0.5 mA, every 20 s). At each stimulation
                  amplitude, the power spectral density (PSD) was computed, and
                  beta power (13–30 Hz) was calculated and correlated with the
                  degree of bradykinesia. Pallidal beta power was reduced when
                  therapeutic stimulation was delivered. Beta power correlated
