                  available datasets, iii) open-source algorithmic solutions and
                  iv) strong world-wide research collaborations.},
  keywords     = {Adaptive deep brain stimulation; Brain-computer interface;
                  Closed-loop DBS; Movement disorders; Neural decoding;
                  Real-time classification},
  language     = {en}
}

