  pages        = {17204--17210},
  date         = {2020-07-21},
  abstract     = {Pigs are considered as important hosts or "mixing vessels" for
                  the generation of pandemic influenza viruses. Systematic
                  surveillance of influenza viruses in pigs is essential for
                  early warning and preparedness for the next potential
                  pandemic. Here, we report on an influenza virus surveillance
