                  emerged genotype 4 (G4) reassortant Eurasian avian-like (EA)
                  H1N1 virus, which bears 2009 pandemic (pdm/09) and
                  triple-reassortant (TR)-derived internal genes and has been
                  predominant in swine populations since 2016. Similar to pdm/09
