  pages        = {145413},
  date         = {2021-05-01},
  abstract     = {Bats are the likely zoonotic origin of several coronaviruses
                  (CoVs) that infect humans, including SARS-CoV-1 and
                  SARS-CoV-2, both of which have caused large-scale epidemics.
                  The number of CoVs present in an area is strongly correlated
