                  consequences. Key to an effective response is to use an
                  appropriate scientific lens to peer through the mist of
                  uncertainty that threatens timely and appropriate decisions
                  surrounding these complex issues. Identifying such corridors
                  of clarity could help understanding critical phenomena or
                  causal pathways sufficiently well to justify taking policy
