                  suggest and comment on their eventual synergistic effects on
                  mental health. The available literature report that climate
                  change, air pollution and COVID-19 pandemic might influence
                  mental health, with disturbances ranging form mild negative
                  emotional responses to full-blown psychiatric conditions,
                  specifically, anxiety and depression, stress/trauma-related
