                  PD and dystonia (beta and theta oscillations) with and without
                  stimulation. Furthermore, we provide an open-source code to
                  facilitate export and analysis of data. Critical aspects of
                  the system are presently related to contact selection,
                  artefact detection, data loss, and synchronization with other
