  abstract     = {We review a recent shift in conceptions of interoception and
                  its relationship to hierarchical inference in the brain. The
                  notion of interoceptive inference means that bodily states are
                  regulated by autonomic reflexes that are enslaved by
                  descending predictions from deep generative models of our
