  date         = {2021-05-15},
  abstract     = {The Anthropocene crisis is frequently described as the
                  rarefaction of resources or resources per capita. However,
                  both energy and minerals correspond to fundamentally conserved
                  quantities from the perspective of physics. A specific concept
                  is required to understand the rarefaction of available
                  resources. This concept, entropy, pertains to energy and
