                  available to investigate the action of drugs on the central
                  nervous system (CNS), determine the pharmacokinetic and
                  pharmacodynamic properties of novel therapeutics and evaluate
                  the CNS penetration or toxicity of compounds. However, a
                  review of the literature reveals inconsistent operating
                  procedures from one study to another. While this fact does not
