  pages        = {738865},
  date         = {2022-02-25},
  abstract     = {Here we present the viewpoint that art essentially engages the
                  social brain, by demonstrating how art processing maps onto
                  the social brain connectome-the most comprehensive diagram of
                  the neural dynamics that regulate human social cognition to
                  date. We start with a brief history of the rise of
