                  appreciation, in relation to developments in contemporary art
                  practice and theory during the same period. Building further
                  on a growing awareness of the importance of social context in
                  art production and appreciation, we then set out how art
                  engages the social brain and outline candidate components of
                  the "artistic brain connectome." We explain how our functional
