  pages        = {150--166},
  date         = {2017-01},
  abstract     = {The idea that there are multiple learning systems has become
                  increasingly influential in recent years, with many studies
                  providing evidence that there is both a quick,
                  similarity-based or feature-based system and a more effortful
                  rule-based system. A smaller number of imaging studies have
