                  mediodorsal thalamus and dopaminergic brainstem nuclei,
                  comprise a discrete regulatory loop circuit. The SN's
                  cortico-striato-thalamo-cortical loop increasingly appears to
                  be central to mechanisms of cognitive control, as well as to a
