  pages        = {1902583},
  date         = {2020-02},
  abstract     = {Ultrasound-based brain stimulation techniques may become a
                  powerful new technique to modulate the human brain in a focal
                  and targeted manner. However, for clinical brain stimulation
                  no certified systems exist and the current techniques have to
                  be further developed. Here, a clinical sonication technique is
