  pages        = {2973--2987},
  date         = {2020-10-01},
  abstract     = {We used 7 T MRI to: (i) characterize the grey and white matter
                  pathology in the cervical spinal cord of patients with early
                  relapsing-remitting and secondary progressive multiple
                  sclerosis; (ii) assess the spinal cord lesion spatial
                  distribution and the hypothesis of an outside-in pathological
