  date         = {2011-12-15},
  abstract     = {Multifunctional agents with limited motor resources must
                  decide what actions will best ensure their survival. Moreover,
                  given that in an unpredictable world things don't always work
                  out, considerable advantage is to be gained by learning from
                  experience - instrumental behaviour that maximises reward and
