  date         = {2021-08-01},
  abstract     = {Cognitive deficits are common in Parkinson's disease (PD),
                  with some PD patients meeting criteria for mild cognitive
                  impairment (MCI). An unaddressed question is whether
                  linguistic prediction is preserved in PD. This ability is
                  nowadays deemed crucial for achieving fast and efficient
