                  attribution for both PD groups compared to HC. A significant
                  correlation emerged between the Ek60 test and emotion
                  attribution. Nine patients showed poor performance at social
                  tasks, five of them being classified as PD-CU. Discussion:
                  Parkinson's disease cognitive profile was characterized by
