  pages        = {409--419},
  date         = {2005-06},
  abstract     = {Psychosurgery, the neurosurgical treatment of psychiatric
                  disease, has a history dating back to antiquity, and involves
                  all of the clinical neurosciences. This review discusses the
                  history of psychosurgery, its development in the 19th century,
