                  disease (PD). METHODS: Observational study of eighteen
                  patients with PD, followed in a prospective, open-label,
                  exploratory trial. Before and after twenty sessions of art
                  therapy, PD patients were assessed with the UPDRS, Pegboard
                  Test, Timed Up and Go Test (TUG), Beck Depression Inventory
                  (BDI), Modified Fatigue Impact Scale and PROMIS-Self-Efficacy,
                  Montreal Cognitive Assessment, Rey-Osterrieth Complex Figure
                  Test (RCFT), Benton Visual Recognition Test (BVRT), Navon
                  Test, Visual Search, and Stop Signal Task. Eye movements were
                  recorded during the BVRT. Resting-state functional MRI
                  (rs-fMRI) was also performed to assess functional connectivity
                  (FC) changes within the dorsal attention (DAN), executive
