  date         = {2020-07},
  abstract     = {BACKGROUND AND PURPOSE: LSVT BIG therapy may improve motor
                  function and gait in those with early Parkinson disease (PD),
                  but its impact on postural control for those with moderate PD
                  has not been investigated. The purpose of this case series is
                  to describe the impact of LSVT BIG therapy on postural control
