                  from individuals with idiopathic PD with confirmed freezing of
                  gait. RESULTS: First, we established that the threatening
                  condition provoked more freezing when compared to the
                  non-threatening condition. By using a dynamic connectivity
                  analysis, we identified patterns of increased "cross-talk"
