  pages        = {425--438},
  date         = {2004-04-20},
  abstract     = {There is an attractive analogy between nature and industry,
                  based on the similarity of natural functions and certain
                  industrial activities. For instance, animals ingest (eat) and
                  digest food. Finally, there are metabolic wastes. Firms are
                  analogous to organisms in several respects, insofar as they
