  date         = {2022-07-20},
  abstract     = {Over the last fifteen years, an ambitious explanatory
                  framework has been proposed to unify explanations across
                  biology and cognitive science. Active inference, whose most
                  famous tenet is the free energy principle, has inspired
                  excitement and confusion in equal measure. Here, we lay the
                  ground for proper critical analysis of active inference, in
