                  interaction difficulties among people with BPD. Design,
                  Setting, and Participants: Cross-brain information flow in BPD
                  was examined from May 25, 2012, to December 4, 2015, in pairs
                  of participants studied in 2 linked functional magnetic
                  resonance imaging scanners in a university setting.
                  Participants performed a joint attention task. Each pair
                  included a healthy control individual (HC) and either a
