                  17), or a second HC (n = 20). Groups were matched for age and
                  educational level. Main Outcomes and Measures: A measure of
                  cross-brain neural coupling was computed following previously
                  published work to indicate synchronized flow between right
                  temporoparietal junction networks (previously shown to host
