  pages        = {887--920},
  date         = {2021-08-01},
  abstract     = {PURPOSE OF REVIEW: Infections of the spine and spinal cord are
                  associated with a high risk of morbidity and mortality and,
                  therefore, require prompt clinical recognition, efficient
                  diagnostic evaluation, and interdisciplinary treatment. This
                  article reviews the pathophysiology, epidemiology, clinical
