  date         = {2022-09-13},
  abstract     = {When neurophysiologists record neural activity from the brain,
                  they often conclude that neural tuning to task variables
                  indicates a functional role of the brain area studied in task
                  performance. However, it remains unknown how reliably such
                  correlations indicate a functional role. To answer this
