  volume       = {11},
  date         = {2022-08-15},
  abstract     = {The spiking activity of populations of cortical neurons is
                  well described by the dynamics of a small number of
                  population-wide covariance patterns, whose activation we refer
                  to as 'latent dynamics'. These latent dynamics are largely
                  driven by the same correlated synaptic currents across the
