  pages        = {1--10},
  date         = {2022-10-23},
  abstract     = {The basal ganglia play a key role in integrating a variety of
                  human behaviors through the cortico–basal
                  ganglia–thalamo–cortical loops. Accordingly, basal ganglia
                  disturbances are implicated in a broad range of debilitating
                  neuropsychiatric disorders. Despite accumulating knowledge of
