                  for new treatments. In the last decade, investigators piloted
                  novel deep brain stimulation (DBS)-based therapies for
                  depression and obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD). Results
                  from recent pivotal trials of these therapies, however, did
                  not demonstrate the degree of efficacy expected from previous
