  pages        = {543--551},
  date         = {2022-12},
  abstract     = {Social interactions are powerful determinants of learning. Yet
                  the field of neuroplasticity is deeply rooted in probing
                  changes occurring in synapses, brain structures, and networks
                  within an individual brain. Here I synthesize disparate
