                  as well as recruitment of eligible patients to ongoing
                  randomized controlled trials to allow for better-informed
                  recommendations in the future.},
  keywords     = {acute ischemic stroke; hyperthermia; hypothermia;
                  normothermia; temperature management},
  language     = {en}
}

@ARTICLE{Dawson2021-ip,
  title        = {European Stroke Organisation expedited recommendation for the
