                  receive direct anatomical projections. We demonstrate these
                  results in a simple neurodynamical model of cholinergic impact
                  on neuronal firing rates and slow hyperpolarizing adaptation
                  currents. We conclude that the cholinergic system plays a
                  critical role in stabilizing macroscale brain state dynamics.},
  keywords     = {CP: Neuroscience; acetylcholine; attractor landscape; brain
