                  various therapeutic interventions for ET. Methods: We did a
                  systematic review and Bayesian Model-based Network
                  Meta-analysis (NMA) of RCTs. Following PRISMA-NMA guidelines,
                  a comprehensive database search was conducted up to April 1,
