                  Markov Chain Monte Carlo (MCMC) method was utilized for the
                  analysis, evaluating the relative efficacy and safety of
                  treatments using standardized mean difference (SMD) and log
                  odds ratios (log ORs), respectively. Additionally, the Surface
                  Under the Cumulative Ranking Curve (SUCRA) was applied to
